  "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t)=\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t\\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t=\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t)=\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t\\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t=\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t+\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t)\\text{d}t & =\\int 2\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t+\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t+\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061t+\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061t+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
